Versioned PostgreSQL schema for VipTop.

From backend/, supply DATABASE_URL (postgresql+psycopg) and run:
    uv run alembic upgrade head
    uv run alembic check

Create subsequent revisions with:
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Describe the schema change"
Review generated revisions before applying them. Revisions retain their own
schema definitions; they must not import live application model definitions.
Downgrading to base destroys collection records. Use disposable storage for
migration verification; application startup never downgrades automatically.
